 "result": "**Line:** `src/tessel/sessions.py:374`, the `response.set_cookie(` call inside `persist_session`.\n\n**Rejected argument:** `partitioned=partitioned`, which is at `sessions.py:382`. Werkzeug 3.0.3's `Response.set_cookie()` has no `partitioned` parameter, so it raises `TypeError: Response.set_cookie() got an unexpected keyword argument 'partitioned'`.\n\nThe same keyword is also passed to `response.delete_cookie(` at `sessions.py:361` (`partitioned=partitioned`). That call would fail the same way, but it only runs when a modified session is emptied, and the tests never reached it.",
